        "title": "RFC 3986 and MDN registerProtocolHandler",
        "citation": "RFC 3986 makes URI schemes extensible. MDN's `registerProtocolHandler` page says a custom scheme registered by a website must start with `web+`.",
        "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/registerProtocolHandler",
        "sourceType": "reference",
        "reliability": "medium",
