      "data": {
        "title": "One address, two verdicts",
        "caveat": "`data:image/png…` is blocked as a link but is a legitimate image source (`contentPaths.js` and the paste handlers accept `data:` and `blob:` for assets). A resolver that answers \"is this safe?\" without being told the use will be wrong one way or the other.",
        "severity": "important",
        "mitigation": "Ask the resolver about a use (link, asset, graph or embed) and give each use its own allowed schemes.",
        "notes": "",
        "identity": {
